        "authors_named_unsolved": "The discussion names three gaps: the database covers cultured prokaryotes only, so uncultured organisms and eukaryotes are unsupported; predictions treat organisms in isolation and ignore metabolite exchange between them; and predictions use all genes in a genome rather than the ones actually expressed.",
